03:52.660 --> 03:58.400
What's even more interesting, and shout out Hot Potato Trader here, because look what we've got down the bottom.

03:58.620 --> 04:01.620
Something we almost never see on crypto Twitter, right?

04:01.720 --> 04:05.980
